From 315df3e7189cecfdc9089965135706c7c6aed81f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:34:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selection and clipboard yanking for
 pane text

Support vim-style visual character, line, and block selection in the focused terminal pane so users can copy visible Work Leaf text without leaving the UI. The terminal state machine starts selection from command mode, TerminalUi renders and extracts selected text, and yanking queues OSC52 clipboard output while the harness records copied text for automated coverage.
